title: An icon goes to the other bar, its open panel goes with it, and it is still there after a restart of the arrangement
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "right": \[\s*"deps"
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "homes": 2
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left files
wait 600
mark a-everything-at-home
wait 400
move deps right
wait 800
mark b-deps-on-the-right-bar
wait 400
right deps
wait 800
mark c-deps-open-on-the-right
wait 400
move files right deps
wait 800
mark d-files-open-moved-with-its-icon
wait 400
move files left
wait 800
mark e-files-back-on-the-left
wait 400
quit
